{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Nowhere Tech, transfer student- where you'll meet people, make choices, make mistakes, and make even more mistakes. You came here to have new experiences and live a little, but you might get more than you bargained for...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate this choice-heavy, dialogue-heavy\u00a0story and crack the code behind your enigmatic new classmate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>INCLUDING:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- TWO semi-dateable beautiful young women!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 4 major linear endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Countless possible diverging routes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Unlockable images and special events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Surprise gameplay at the most inopportune time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Content Warnings:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cursing, discussion of sexual themes, drug references- typical college life stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Any resemblance of characters, events, or themes to real people in my life\u00a0is unintended. Probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637820?t=1745419948","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637820?t=1745419948","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637820/dbf075dfd35f890bf9122ab4a4cecda49553d91d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745419948","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637820/dbf075dfd35f890bf9122ab4a4cecda49553d91d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745419948","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids"